sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Outpost
    participant Vault
    participant Supabase
    User->>Outpost: Select Supabase method and agent access
    alt Hosted MCP browser sign-in
        Outpost->>Supabase: Read protected resource and issuer metadata
        Outpost->>Supabase: Register instance OAuth client
        Outpost->>User: Open authorization URL
        User->>Supabase: Choose organization and consent
        Supabase->>Outpost: Instance callback with authorization code
        Outpost->>Supabase: Exchange code with PKCE
    else Personal access token
        User->>Outpost: Enter token and optional or required project reference
    end
    Outpost->>Vault: Store selected grant credential
    Outpost->>Supabase: MCP discovery or native project probe
    User->>Outpost: Set action permissions
    Outpost->>Outpost: Authorize agent run and selected grant
    Outpost->>Vault: Resolve selected invocation credential
    Outpost->>Supabase: Invoke permitted action
    Outpost->>Outpost: Record bounded result and audit
